Sun Oct 18 18:05:11 UTC 2026 - jan gaza <jangaza@proton.me>

- Update to version 0.2026.10.12b:
  * Added support for Minecraft 26.3
  * Added support for raw input sensitivity multiplier
  * Added waywall.set_raw_sensitivity to the Lua API
  * Subprocesses are now killed with SIGTERM instead of SIGKILL
  * Added logging for XDG_SESSION_DESKTOP
  * Fixed crashes when using River 0.4 and Jay compositors
  * Fixed MCSR Launcher instances not being recognized
  * Fixed a crash when spawned subprocesses exit on NVIDIA systems
  * Fixed a crash when the same coroutine resumes more than once

